theme = ExtResource("1_xr86y")
text = "How to play?

Move left to right using A and D or left and right arrows

Press w or up arrow or space to jump

Grab a falling hammer when in range by pressing left mouse button

Then swing mouse up and relese the button to throw hammer above marked line

If you hit a nail with a hammer you will score bonus poinst"

